From 87c303905ca2521ea74258886ba6c1eb409d407b Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <claude@anthropic.com>
Date: Thu, 19 Feb 2026 14:54:05 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Fix profile not updating + knowledge map overlap

Bug fixes:
1. AuthProvider: merge DB data with localStorage instead of overwriting
   - Prevents losing explorations/progress on every page refresh
   - Uses profileRef to avoid stale closure issues
2. Lesson page: save scroll progress to Zustand store
   - Tracks lesson access time and percent complete
   - Saves on interval (30s) and on page leave
3. Deep dive quiz: persist scores to store via updateExploration
   - Calculates percentage score when all questions answered
4. Knowledge map: replace overlapping circle layout with clean grid
   - Shows lessons with their explored terms as tags
   - Deep dives marked with checkmark

New files:
- lib/hooks/usePersistToDb.ts: syncs Zustand changes to Supabase for auth users
- supabase/setup.sql: complete DB schema with RLS policies

Updates:
- Profile lesson names extended for lessons 6-8
- providers.tsx: wires DbSyncProvider for real-time DB sync
